# Helm templates are Go template syntax wrapped in YAML, not plain YAML —
# Prettier's YAML parser can't read `{{ }}` and fails on every file.
# `helm lint`/`helm template` are this directory's own formatting/validity
# gate instead.
deploy/helm/copalibre/templates/

# Impeccable's generated design artifacts. `/impeccable document` writes DESIGN.md
# and the sidecar, and `impeccable hooks` owns config.json — those generators are
# the only writers, so their output must stay canonical. Prettier reflows the
# frontmatter's quote style and collapses the config's arrays, which would make
# every regeneration look like drift and would break the DESIGN.md-vs-token-source
# comparison that compares values exactly (openspec change 0224).
DESIGN.md
